  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Illusory Fairy Li Jun Ying stands beside Xu Hao when Zhao Lian Yun returns from a Thieving Heaven arrangement. The couple are named the most important people in the anti-Feng faction inside Spirit Affinity House.",
      "chapters": [
        949
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xu_hao",
        "char_zhao_lian_yun",
        "fac_spirit_affinity_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She and Xu Hao treat Zhao Lian Yun’s rise as a way to suppress Bai Qing and regain House authority against Feng Jin Huang’s line. Li Jun Ying greets Zhao Lian Yun, shakes her shoulders in excitement, and explains divine concealment with Xu Hao when Zhao Lian Yun names that gain. Li Jun Ying cites Heaven’s Envy Manor’s report of Ao Xue and Ling Mei’s deaths to console Xu Hao over Feng Jiu Ge’s uncertain fate.",
      "chapters": [
        949
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-and-authority",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_bai_qing",
        "char_feng_jin_huang",
        "fac_heavens_envy_sect",
        "char_fairy_ao_xue",
        "char_fairy_ling_mei",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zhao Lian Yun’s information leads Xu Hao and Li Jun Ying to deduce Feng Jiu Ge is trapped inside the Thieving Heaven inheritance, and they suppress this before Zhao Lian Yun is sent to Northern Plains for his rescue.",
      "chapters": [
        950
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-and-authority",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Her will later reports to a second supreme elder that Fairy Bai Qing has already gone to explore Falling Heavenly River’s source.",
      "chapters": [
        957
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-and-authority",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_falling_heavenly_river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "News that Feng Jiu Ge survived leaves Li Jun Ying and Xu Hao uneasy, since they had intentionally delayed and hidden word of Zhao Lian Yun’s rise and expect him to suppress them for it once he returns.",
      "chapters": [
        993
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-and-authority",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Li Jun Ying’s power is extraordinary.",
      "chapters": [
        1192
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-and-authority",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the previous life, after Feng Jiu Ge died inside the Thieving Heaven true inheritance’s special space, she and Xu Hao immediately exerted pressure on Fairy Bai Qing and had a powerful stance.",
      "chapters": [
        1192
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-and-authority",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But afterwards Fang Yuan used Spring Autumn Cicada and ended up saving Feng Jiu Ge, and history was changed.",
      "chapters": [
        1192
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-and-authority",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiu Ge’s return leaves her and Xu Hao at a disadvantage, but using Zhao Lian Yun’s influence the two hold their ground and are untouchable by even Feng Jiu Ge inside Spirit Affinity House.",
      "chapters": [
        1192
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-and-authority",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spirit Affinity House later puts names forward after Li Jun Ying and Xu Hao block Feng Jin Huang from an opportunity list.",
      "chapters": [
        1971
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zhao-lian-yun-and-authority",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
